      "How should product, interface, patent, and system contributions be allocated among Ive, named designers, engineers, executives, manufacturers, and Apple?",
      "Who owns and governs LoveFrom, what rights do Marc Newson and other collaborators hold, and what succession or continuity arrangements exist?",
      "What were the terms and work product of Apple's LoveFrom consulting agreement? The New York Times reported in 2022 that the multiyear contract was valued at more than $100 million, citing people with knowledge of the agreement who were not named. Neither company has confirmed the figure.",
      "What was io Products' cap table, what consideration reached each holder, and which intellectual property, liabilities, employees, and contracts transferred to OpenAI?",
      "What formal authority does Ive exercise across OpenAI, and how are conflicts among LoveFrom clients, OpenAI, and continuing independent work governed?",
