    payoff: "Ive shows that extraordinary personal authority can become more portable after institutional exit while remaining inseparable from collective labor and entity-specific rights. The durable institution is the documented system of collaborators, contracts, ownership, attribution, governance, evidence, and succession that can carry the work when the famous person is absent.",
