      "The sale to Informa shows continuity across ownership change while also showing that capital allocation, portfolio design, and ultimate governance sit above the LIONS CEO.",
      "The 2025 withdrawal of winning work is adverse evidence against treating awards legitimacy as self-executing. The integrity framework is a corrective response, not proof that verification failures are solved.",
